     produce this transit shape. The live explanations are (i) the
     grazing degeneracy put the fit on the wrong branch, (ii) the
     orbit is eccentric, (iii) the host is not the star the Mann
     relations describe (unresolved blend). This is a result to
     report, not a number to average away.
